    "scr_dup": "007",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>期末考試規定：學生若需補考，必須於考試後&nbsp;3 天內依學校規定提出申請。未於考試當日到場，且未申請補考者，其期末考成績以零分計算。<strong>若學生考試請假原由符合學校規定</strong><strong>, </strong><strong>補考成績依實際成績計算; </strong><strong>若不合, </strong><strong>則打8</strong><strong>折</strong></div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Be on time. 請準時上課。\n2. Participate in the class discussion and class activities. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n3. Students must submit a leave application to the school in advance, stating the reason for the leave and the expected duration.學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。\n4. Please purchase original textbook, following intellectual property law. 請購買正版課本，請勿使用複製版本。\n5. The texts and exercises will be completed in class. Please bring textbooks to class. 請上課攜帶課本，以利上課活動使用。\n6.  Final Exam Policy: Students who need to retake the exam must apply within 3 days after the exam date, according to school regulations. Students who are absent on the exam day and do not apply for a make-up exam will receive a score of zero for the final exam. If the student’s reason for taking leave complies with school regulations, the make-up exam score will be based on the actual performance; if not, it will be reduced by 20%.期末考試規定：學生若需補考，必須於考試後 3 天內依學校規定提出申請。未於考試當日到場，且未申請補考者，其期末考成績以零分計算。若學生考試請假原由符合學校規定, 補考成績依實際成績計算; 若不合, 則打8折。\n7. Following the FCU Exam Regulations, cheaters will receive ZERO for their exams and such cases will be reviewed by the Student Reward and Disciplinary Committee. 考試請遵照考場規定，若作弊者以0分計算。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。<br />\nPlagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。<br />\nCheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
